 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B>DBV Technologies S.A. </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">177-181</FONT> Avenue Pierre Brossolette </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B>92120 Montrouge France </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B>NOTICE OF ANNUAL COMBINED GENERAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B>To Be Held at 10:00 AM Paris Time on May&nbsp;16, 2024 </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">To Shareholders of DBV Technologies S.A.: </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The
2024 Annual Combined General Meeting of Shareholders of DBV Technologies S.A. (the &#147;Company&#148;), a French soci&eacute;t&eacute; anonyme, will be held on May&nbsp;16, 2024, at 10:00 AM Paris time at the Company&#146;s new headquarters located
at 107 avenue de la R&eacute;publique 92320 Ch&acirc;tillon, France. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><U>Within the authority of the Ordinary Shareholders&#146; Meeting:
</U></P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
