STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-emptive</FONT> rights, by means of a public offer referred to in paragraph 1 of Article <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">L.411-2</FONT> of the French Monetary and Financial Code </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
