 DEBT SECURITIES (OF THE COMPANY OR A GROUP COMPANY), AND/OR SECURITIES GIVING ACCESS TO ORDINARY SHARES (OF THE COMPANY OR A GROUP COMPANY), WITHOUT PRE-EMPTIVE RIGHTS, BY MEANS OF A PUBLIC OFFER REFERRED TO IN PARAGRAPH&nbsp;1 OF ARTICLE L.411-2
OF THE FRENCH MONETARY AND FINANCIAL CODE</A></TD>
