A GROUP COMPANY) AND/OR SECURITIES GIVING ACCESS TO ORDINARY SHARES (OF THE COMPANY OR A GROUP COMPANY), WITH PRE-EMPTIVE SUBSCRIPTION RIGHTS WAIVED IN FAVOR OF CATEGORIES OF PERSONS MEETING SPECIFIED CHARACTERISTICS</A></TD>
