OF A CATEGORY OF PERSONS MEETING SPECIFIED CHARACTERISTICS WITHIN THE FRAMEWORK OF AN EQUITY FINANCING AGREEMENT ON THE UNITED STATES STOCK MARKET KNOWN AS &#147;AT-THE-MARKET OFFERING&#148; OR &#147;ATM PROGRAM&#148;</A></TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
