 BY APPLICABLE LAWS AND REGULATIONS AT THE TIME OF THE IMPLEMENTATION OF THIS DELEGATION (ON AN INDICATIVE BASIS, CURRENTLY 10% OF THE CAPITAL), IN CONSIDERATION FOR CONTRIBUTIONS IN KIND OF EQUITY SECURITIES OR SECURITIES GIVING ACCESS TO THE
CAPITAL</A></TD>
