 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B><A NAME="toc695742_1"></A>IMPORTANT INFORMATION ABOUT THE ANNUAL MEETING AND VOTING
</B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The information provided in the &#147;question and answer&#148; format below is for your convenience only and is merely a summary of the information
contained in this proxy statement. You should read this entire proxy statement carefully. Information contained on, or that can be accessed through, our website is not intended to be incorporated by reference into this proxy statement and references
to our website address in this proxy statement are inactive textual references only. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>What matters will be voted at the Annual General Meeting?
</B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">There are 38 proposed resolutions (the &#147;Proposals&#148;) scheduled to be considered and voted on at the Annual General Meeting:
</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><U>Within the authority of the Ordinary Shareholders&#146; Meeting: </U></P>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
