conclusions made by the French High Council of Statutory Auditors following controls carried out pursuant to Articles L. <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">821-9</FONT> et seq. of the French Commercial Code; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
