<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">(2)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Amounts relating to base salary and equity incentive plan compensation in 2022 have been converted from euros
to U.S. dollars at a rate of &#128;1.00 = $1.0813, which represents the average exchange rate for the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2023, and amounts relating to <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-equity</FONT> incentive plan compensation have been
converted from euros to U.S. dollars at a rate of &#128;1.00 = $1.087, which represents the BCE fixing exchange rate on January&nbsp;5, 2023 (date of approval by the Board meeting of this compensation). </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
