until her earlier death, resignation, or removal. Ms.&nbsp;Julie O&#146;Neill has agreed to serve if <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">re-elected,</FONT> and we have no reason to believe that she will be unable to serve. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Ms.&nbsp;Julie O&#146;Neill&#146;s biography is provided above under &#147;Board of Directors and Corporate Governance&#151;Board of
Directors.&#148; </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Proposal 8 </B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The
Board proposes to renew the term as Director of Ms.&nbsp;Dani&egrave;le Guyot-Caparros. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Ms.&nbsp;Dani&egrave;le Guyot-Caparros is
currently a member of our Board and has been nominated for <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">re-election</FONT> as director. If <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">re-elected,</FONT> she will hold office from the date of her <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">re-election</FONT> for a period of three years, to expire at the end of the general meeting occurring in 2027, where she must retire by rotation and offer herself for <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">re-election,</FONT> or
until her earlier death, resignation, or removal. Ms.&nbsp;Dani&egrave;le Guyot-Caparros has agreed to serve if <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">re-elected,</FONT> and we have no reason to believe that she will be unable to serve. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Ms.&nbsp;Dani&egrave;le Guyot-Caparros&#146;s biography is provided above under &#147;Board of Directors and Corporate Governance&#151;Board
of Directors.&#148; </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Proposal 9 </B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The
