issue, the terms and conditions of their subscription and payment and their date of entitlement to dividends, and to determine the dates and terms of issue, the nature, number and characteristics
of the shares and/or securities to be created and issued; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
