<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">2)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">acknowledges that the reverse split operations shall commence, at the earliest, upon expiry of a period of
fifteen (15)&nbsp;days from the date of publication, by the Company, of the notice of the reverse split in the <I>Bulletin des Annonces L&eacute;gales Obligatoires</I> (BALO); </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">3)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">decides that the exchange period during which the shareholders must purchase and sell the Existing Shares
required to effect the reverse split shall be of a maximum duration of thirty (30)&nbsp;days from the start of the reverse split operations, the date of which will be set in the notice of reverse split published in the BALO ; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">4)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">acknowledges that, in accordance with article 6 of Decree no. <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">48-1683</FONT>
of October&nbsp;30, 1948, shareholders who own an isolated number of Existing Shares or a number of Existing Shares that is less than the number required for the reverse split shall be obliged to carry out the necessary purchases or sales of
Existing Shares for the reverse split within a period of thirty (30)&nbsp;days from the start of the reverse split operation; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">5)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">acknowledges that, at the end of the exchange period, the New Shares that could not be allocated individually
and corresponding to fractional rights will be sold, and that the proceeds of this sale will be allocated in proportion to the fractional rights (rompus) of each rights holder, in accordance with article 6 of Decree no. <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">48-1683</FONT> of October&nbsp;30, 1948 and R. <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">228-12</FONT> of the French Commercial Code; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">6)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">acknowledges that the New Shares resulting from the reverse split will have the same characteristics and grant
the same rights as the Existing Shares they replace. At the end of the reverse split period, the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-consolidated</FONT> Existing Shares will lose their voting rights and will no longer be included in the calculation
of the quorum and their rights to future dividends will be suspended; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">7)</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">grants all powers to the Board of Directors, for a period of twelve (12)&nbsp;months from the date of this
General Meeting, with the power to <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">sub-delegate,</FONT> to implement this decision, in particular for the purpose of: </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR style = "page-break-inside:avoid">
