<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">the securities giving access to ordinary shares to be issued immediately or in the future by the Company may
consist in particular of debt securities or warrants, or be associated with the issue of such securities, or allow their issue as intermediate securities ; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
