<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">in the event of the issue of stock warrants, to determine the number and characteristics of such warrants and to
decide, if it deems appropriate, on terms and conditions to be determined by it, that the warrants may be redeemed or repurchased, or that they shall be allocated free of charge to the shareholders in proportion to their interest in the share
