<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">notes that this delegation of authority supersedes, as from the date hereof, the unused portion, if applicable,
of the delegation of authority granted by the General Meeting of April&nbsp;12, 2023, in its twentieth resolution. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Twenty-first
