equity securities to be issued, without <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-emptive</FONT> rights, by means of a public offer (excluding the offers set out in paragraph 1 of Article <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">L.411-2</FONT> of the French
