resolution shall not exceed the limit determined by applicable laws and regulations at the time of the implementation of this delegation (on an indicative basis, currently 20% of the share capital per year) and shall be deducted from the overall
ceiling provided for in the thirtieth resolution of this Meeting; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
