<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">sub-delegation</FONT> under the conditions provided for by law, to implement this delegation, and therefore to: </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
