<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">to decide to issue shares and/or securities and to determine their characteristics, determine the amount to be
issued, the issue price and the amount of the premium that can, if applicable, be demanded at issue, the terms and conditions of their subscription and payment and their date of entitlement to dividends, and to determine the dates and terms of
issue, the nature, number and characteristics of the shares and/or securities to be created and issued; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
