STYLE="white-space:nowrap">225-118</FONT> of the French Commercial Code (i.e., to date, within thirty days of the closing of the subscription, at the same price as that used for the initial issue and up to a limit of 15% of the issue price) and
within the limit of the ceiling(s) provided for in the resolution pursuant to which the issue is decided, when the Board of Directors identifies excess demand for subscriptions, in particular with a view to granting an over-allotment option in
accordance with market practices; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
