<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">this amount will be increased, if necessary, by any redemption premium above par and is independent of the amount
of debt securities whose issuance could result from the use of other resolutions submitted to this Meeting and of debt securities whose issuance would be decided or authorized by the Board of Directors in accordance with articles <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap"><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">L.228-36-A,</FONT></FONT> <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">L.228-40,</FONT> <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">L.228-92</FONT> paragraph 3, <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">L.228-93</FONT>
paragraph 6 and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">L.228-94</FONT> paragraph 3 of the French Commercial Code; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
