paragraph 6 and L. <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">228-94</FONT> paragraph 3 of the French Commercial Code; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
