<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">9.&#8195;&#8201;Renewal of Mr.&nbsp;Ravi&nbsp;M.
Rao, as director,</P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">10.&#8194;&#8201;Approval
of the information set out in section I of Article <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap"><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">L.22-10-9</FONT></FONT> of the French Commercial Code on the compensation of corporate officers for the year ended December&nbsp;31,
2023,</P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">11.&#8194;&#8201;Approval of the fixed,
