split,</P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">20.&#8194;&#8201;Delegation of powers
to be granted to the Board of Directors to issue ordinary shares and/or equity securities giving access to other equity securities or to the allocation of debt securities and/or securities giving access to ordinary shares with <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-emptive</FONT> rights,</P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">21.&#8194;&#8201;Delegation of powers to be granted to the Board of Directors to issue ordinary shares and/ or equity
