<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">27.&#8194;&#8201;Delegation of powers to be
granted to the Board of Directors to increase the capital by means of the issue of ordinary shares and/or securities giving access to the capital, up to the limit determined</P>
