<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:0.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">et/ou d&#146;acquisition d&#146;actions nouvelles et/ou existantes remboursables (BSAAR) avec suppression du droit
pr&eacute;f&eacute;rentiel de souscription au profit d&#146;une cat&eacute;gorie de personnes,</P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">34.&#8194;&#8201;Autorisation &agrave; donner au Conseil d&#146;Administration en vue d&#146;attribuer gratuitement
des actions existantes et/ou &agrave; &eacute;mettre aux membres du personnel salari&eacute; et/ou certains mandataires sociaux de la Soci&eacute;t&eacute; ou des soci&eacute;t&eacute;s ou groupements d&#146;int&eacute;r&ecirc;t &eacute;conomique
li&eacute;s,</P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">35.&#8194;&#8201;Autorisation
&agrave; donner au Conseil d&#146;Administration en vue d&#146;octroyer des options de souscription et/ou d&#146;achat d&#146;actions (stock-options) aux membres du personnel salari&eacute; et/ou certains mandataires sociaux de la
Soci&eacute;t&eacute; ou des soci&eacute;t&eacute;s ou groupements d&#146;int&eacute;r&ecirc;t &eacute;conomique li&eacute;s,</P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">36.&#8194;&#8201;Ratification du transfert du si&egrave;ge social d&eacute;cid&eacute; par le Conseil
d&#146;Administration,</P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">37.&#8194;&#8201;Modification de l&#146;article 3 des statuts,</P>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt; margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>&Agrave; caract&egrave;re ordinaire :</B></P>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">38.&#8194;&#8201;Pouvoirs pour les
formalit&eacute;s.</P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt; margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt">&nbsp;</P></TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom" STYLE=" BORDER-TOP:1px solid #000000; BORDER-BOTTOM:1px solid #000000">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top" STYLE="BORDER-TOP:1px solid #000000; BORDER-RIGHT:1px solid #000000; BORDER-BOTTOM:1px solid #000000">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom" STYLE=" BORDER-TOP:1px solid #000000; BORDER-BOTTOM:1px solid #000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top" STYLE="BORDER-TOP:1px solid #000000; BORDER-RIGHT:1px solid #000000; BORDER-BOTTOM:1px solid #000000; padding-right:2pt"> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">34.&#8194;&#8201;Authorization to be granted to the Board of Directors to allocate for free existing and/or to be
issued shares to employees and/or certain corporate officers of the company or related companies or economic interest groups,</P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">35.&#8194;&#8201;Authorization to be granted to the Board of Directors to grant options to subscribe and/or purchase
shares (stock options) to employees and/or certain officers of the Company or related companies or economic interest groups,</P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">36.&#8194;&#8201;Ratification of the headquarters&#146; transfer decided by the Board of Directors,</P>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">37.&#8194;&#8201;Consequential amendment of
article 3 of the Company&#146;s <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">by-laws,</FONT></P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt; margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Ordinary resolutions:</B></P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">38.&#8194;&#8201;Powers to complete formalities.</P>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt; margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt">&nbsp;</P></TD></TR>
