<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">As set forth in Section&nbsp;4.10 of the Deposit Agreement and the Form of ADR, Holders of record of ADSs as of
the close of business on the ADS Record Date and who continue to hold their ADS as of the French Record Date will be entitled, subject to any applicable provisions of the Deposit Agreement, French law and the bylaws of the Company and the provisions
of or governing the Deposited Securities, to instruct the Depositary as to the exercise of the voting rights, if any, pertaining to the Shares represented by such Holders&#146; ADSs. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
</DIV></Center>

